OL,3,Vupppppp5CThursday
OL,5,G2230 Battlefront: WWII Road to Victory
OL,6,     FThe Allies launch an ill-fated
OL,7,     Fattack on the German-occupied port
OL,8,     Fof Dieppe, France, where the Nazis
OL,9,     Fproved to be too strong.
OL,10,G2300 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,11,     FJim overpowers Geoff, and Meg is
OL,12,     Fhorrified by the violence. Bea
OL,13,     Fhelps Pat write a letter, but
OL,14,     Fgetting it out isn't a simple
OL,15,     Fmatter.
OL,16,G0000 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,17,     FEveryone is questioned over the
OL,18,     Fstriking incident. Herbie is
OL,19,     Fcaught in a lie, and changes his
OL,20,     Fstatement. Erica gets wind that
OL,21,     FVera is using Chrissie as an
OL,22,     Finformant.
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
