OL,3,Vupppppp5CThursday
OL,5,G0100 The Yorkshire Vet
OL,6,     FShona Searson rushes to an
OL,7,     Femergency calving, while Peter
OL,8,     FWright's patient is a Samoyed - a
OL,9,     Fdog originally bred for herding
OL,10,     Freindeer and pulling sleds in the
OL,11,     FArctic.
OL,12,G0200 The Yorkshire Vet
OL,13,     FRohin Aojula helps a ewe that
OL,14,     Fpushed out her uterus after giving
OL,15,     Fbirth, Julian Norton operates on a
OL,16,     FDalmatian with an eye ulcer, and
OL,17,     FPeter Wright treats the oldest cow
OL,18,     Fhe's met.
